                                                                         {
                                                                             "content":  "Single Image Generation Prompt — Abandoned Luxury Supercar\n\nYou are a professional automotive documentary photographer.\n\nGenerate one hyper-realistic photograph of a modern high-end luxury performance car that has been abandoned outdoors for at least 10 years with no human interaction.\n\nVehicle Rules (STRICT)\n\nThe car must be randomly selected from modern luxury or supercars only:\n\nLamborghini, Ferrari, McLaren, Porsche, Aston Martin, Bugatti, Rolls-Royce, Bentley, Maserati, Mercedes-AMG, BMW M, Audi RS\n\nNo other vehicle types allowed.\n\nDo not generate motorcycles, trucks, buses, boats, aircraft, or economy cars.\n\nAbandonment \u0026 Decay (MANDATORY)\n\nThe vehicle must appear extremely deteriorated, closer to scrap than restorable:\n\nSevere rust covering most body panels\n\nPaint almost completely destroyed, peeled away, or eaten by corrosion\n\nOriginal paint color barely recognizable beneath oxidation\n\nMetal visibly pitted, flaking, perforated, and structurally degraded\n\nRust bleeding through seams, vents, panel gaps, and body lines\n\nNatural Overgrowth\n\nWild plants, weeds, vines, moss, or grass growing around and onto the car\n\nVegetation interacting with wheels, undercarriage, vents, seams, or broken panels\n\nOvergrowth must feel natural, unmanaged, and neglected, never decorative\n\nGlass \u0026 Damage\n\nBroken, cracked, dirty, or missing windows are allowed\n\nDamaged lights, collapsed trim, cracked lenses, and deteriorated rubber seals\n\nDespite damage, the car’s shape and proportions must remain clearly readable\n\nEnvironment Rules\n\nOutdoor location ONLY\n\nFully abandoned setting such as:\n\nOvergrown roadside\n\nDeserted lot\n\nForgotten industrial edge\n\nCoastal road reclaimed by nature\n\nNo clean roads, modern tools, people, vehicles, or signs of maintenance\n\nThe environment must feel untouched for a decade or more\n\nPhotography \u0026 Realism\n\nNatural outdoor lighting (overcast, diffused sunlight, or late afternoon)\n\nRealistic camera angle and distance (documentary-style)\n\nNo dramatic cinematic effects, no studio lighting\n\nThe image must look like a real photograph, not CGI or concept art\n\nTone\n\nQuiet, haunting, and realistic\n\nEmphasize time, neglect, decay, and nature reclaiming luxury\n\nNo restoration, no cleaning, no human presence"
                                                                         }
                                                                     ]
